    "ls|LS17_S3_U_72": "LOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 72 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 3rd FEBRUARY, 2020 \n \nSetting up of New Petrol Pumps \n \n72.  SHRI MANNE SRINIVAS REDDY: \n \nपेट्रोलियम एवं प्राकृतिक गैस मंत्री \n \nWill the Minister of PETROLEUM AND NATURAL GAS be pleased to \nstate: \n \n(a) the details of petrol pumps in the country, State -wise with special reference to \nTelangana;  \n \n(b) whether any assessment has been made to know the number of petrol pumps \nin the country, if so, the details thereof, State-wise;  \n \n(c) whether it is true t hat OMCs have decided to set up 65,000 petrol pumps in \nthe country, if so, the details thereof; and  \n \n(d) whether focus would be made to set up petrol pumps in rural areas and if so, \nthe details thereof? \n \nANSWER \n \nपेट्रोलियम एवं प्राकृतिक गैस मंत्री (श्री धमेन्द्र प्रधान) \n \nMINISTER OF PETROLEUM AND NATURAL GAS \n(SHRI DHARMENDRA PRADHAN) \n \n \n(a)  The details of State -wise number of Retail Outlets  (ROs) of Public \nSector Oil Marketing Companies (OMCs) including in Telangana \nState as on 01.01.2020 are at Annexure.  \n \n(b) to (d) Expansion of ROs network by Public Sector OMCs in the country \nincluding in the Rural and Remote areas is a continuous process. \nROs are set up by Public Sector OMCs at identified locations based \non field survey and feasibility studies. Locations found to be having \nsufficient potential as well as economically viable are rostered in the \nMarketing Plans for advertisement for setting up ROs.     \n Public Sector OMCs have issued advertisement s for award of new \nRetail Outlet dealerships on 25.1 1.2018 and 14.12.2018 on pan \nIndia basis including in rural areas. Status of these advertisements \nas on 01.01.2020 are as below :-    \n \nLocation advertised LOI issued RO Commissioned \n79312 18310 1815 \n \n**** \n\n \n \nAnnexure  \n  Anneuxre referred to in reply to part (a) of Lok Sabha Unstarred \nQuestion No.72 for 3.2.2020 asked by Shri Manne Srinivas Reddy, \nMP regarding Setting up of New Petrol Pumps.  \n  OMC : Number of existing Retail Outlets as on 01.01.2020 \nSTATES OMC \nAndaman & Nicobar 15 \nAndhra Pradesh 3212 \nArunachal Pradesh 89 \nAssam 860 \nBihar 2837 \nChandigarh 42 \nChhattisgarh 1354 \nDadra & Nagar Haveli 25 \nDaman & Diu 28 \nDelhi 394 \nGoa 118 \nGujarat 3237 \nHaryana 2768 \nHimachal Pradesh 466 \nJammu & Kashmir 525 \nJharkhand 1212 \nKarnataka 4176 \nKerala 2059 \nLakshadweep 0 \nMadhya Pradesh 3618 \nMaharashtra 5706 \nManipur 122 \nMeghalaya 208 \nMizoram 43 \nNagaland 75 \nOdisha 1671 \nPuducherry 154 \nPunjab 3295 \nRajasthan 3948 \nSikkim 51 \nTamil Nadu 4988 \nTelangana 2637 \nTripura 76 \n\nUttar Pradesh 7289 \nUttarakhand 586 \nWest Bengal 2343 \nALL-INDIA 60227 \n ",
